# Review: Supertraining Ch 6a (6.1-6.3), 28 entries

Reviewer: Claude Opus (independent falsification pass). Date: 2026-10-03.
Source: `staging/books/supertraining-6th-expanded.pdf`, PDF idx 324-347 (printed 313-336). Text pulled with PyMuPDF; every figure and table checked against 200 dpi renders in `staging/_renders/r6a_p*.png`. I opened the images for PDF 330 (Fig 6.1), 332 (Ryun Fig 6.2), 333 (second Fig 6.2, Figs 6.3-6.5), 334 (Fig 6.6, worked example), 335 (Fig 6.7, Table 6.1), 336 (notations, Table 6.2), 341 (Table 6.5) and 343 (order/causal analysis, Chernyak).
Baseline: every "Eric's baseline:" quote checked against `docs/method-baseline.md` lines 104, 105, 106, 107, 108, 142, 179, 180, 181, 183, 185, 186, 187. All quotes are verbatim and all tags are correct. Line 106 (undulating loading) is quoted exactly with tag "Explicit (interview 2026-09-28, Q1)".
Wikilinks: all `[[...]]` targets in the 28 files resolve to files in the vault library or the staging library. None are broken.

