Scope: the 28 files in `staging/_scope_supertraining_ch6a.txt`. I edited the 6 flagged entries, plus 3 GO entries for the optional Related links. No new entries, so the scope file is unchanged (28 lines). No renames. I did not edit `_book.md`, any 6b, 6c or 6d file, or the vault.

